  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate and air pollution</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Klimat och luftf&#xf6;rorening</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The Global Atmospheric Pollution Forum (Global Forum) har ett program f&#xf6;r att unders&#xf6;ka samband och synergier mellan policies i olika skalor att behandla b&#xe5;de luftf&#xf6;roreningar och klimatf&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar. Ett m&#xf6;te h&#xf6;lls i Stockholm 17-19 september 2008 med forskare, policy makers och olika experter fr&#xe5;n 30 l&#xe4;nder.  http://sei-international.org/gapforum/</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Atmospheric Pollution Forum (Global Forum) is undertaking a programme to examine the potential linkages and synergies  (co-benefits) between policies at various scales to address both air pollution and climate change, A workshop was held in Stockholm, Sweden, from 17 to 19 September, 2008, bringing together scientists, policy makers and various experts from 30 countries.</narrative>
  </description>
